---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="ko"
  title="Uniquefacturing | UFAC"
  description="Uniquefacturing (UFAC) — 기술력을 높이는 연구개발 파트너. Prototype Studio."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <img class="hero-mark" src="/images/LOGO.png" alt="" width="320" height="320" />
      <p class="eyebrow">Uniquefacturing</p>
      <h1>기술력을 높이는 연구개발 파트너</h1>
      <p class="lead">Prototype Studio</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn">프로젝트 문의</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>소개</h2>
      <p>Uniquefacturing은 구상을 실물로 만드는 일을 합니다. 기획부터 완성까지 책임지고 함께합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>연락처</h2>
      <p class="contact-email"><a href="mailto:uni@ufac.dev">uni@ufac.dev</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
